  {
    "path": "World/Crusade/RankUps/Diplomacy/Diplomacy_8/Cue_0024.jbp",
    "text": "\"Once, I saw a general in you. Now I see a capable politician as well. I am grateful to you for fulfilling your duty and helping my nation.\"",
    "AssetId": "45258075a3a79bf4c91a90dd22ed6145",
