  {
    "path": "World/Crusade/RankUps/Diplomacy/Diplomacy_8/Cue_0025.jbp",
    "text": "\"I wasn't a diplomat before this war, and I haven't become one now. But I think I'm beginning to understand politicians and their actions better. And I'm convinced that the key is never to forsake your conscience. I don't think we have.\"",
    "AssetId": "d731f9cfaad51cf4e8e7f581abcb056e",
