  {
    "path": "World/Crusade/RankUps/Diplomacy/Diplomacy_8/Cue_0027.jbp",
    "text": "\"I can't imagine ever becoming a proper diplomat. All this political skullduggery makes my hand reach for my bow; I was this close to going down in history as Lann the Shooting Ambassador. But I'm impressed with how slick you were at dealing with intrigues and weaving a web of your own.\"",
    "AssetId": "e24c96e430037dc4381751f8cecf7727",
    "Data": {
      "$type": "8eee9d45ddcfa614d99610c1892993e3, BlueprintCue",
