  {
    "path": "World/Crusade/RankUps/Diplomacy/Diplomacy_8/Cue_0080.jbp",
    "text": "\"Looks like politics isn't such a big deal after all. It's just like the gangs on the streets, apart from the cussing. Maybe I should be a diplomat after the war?\"",
