  {
    "path": "World/Crusade/RankUps/Diplomacy/Diplomacy_8/Cue_0081.jbp",
    "text": "\"It has been an honor and a pleasure to advise you, Commander. However, I don't think you will need my counsel from here on out. Mendev stands strong, our allies are loyal and reliable. The Diplomatic Council has served its purpose; you don't need it any longer.\"",
    "AssetId": "7f64a30ceb4bfb046990bccbded7ac75",
