  {
    "path": "World/Crusade/RankUps/Diplomacy/Diplomacy_8/Cue_0097.jbp",
    "text": "\"This war has left too many wounds on the body of my nation. It is high time we healed them. Let any who wish to risk their lives for a just cause come to me, and I shall name them my knight and a noble of Mendev.\"",
