  {
    "path": "World/Crusade/RankUps/Diplomacy/Diplomacy_Officer/Cue_0029.jbp",
    "text": "\"However regrettable it may be to admit, only foreign interference was able to save Mendev from ruin. The garrisons in the cities took authority into their own hands. Robberies were weeded out, and tax collection, order enforcement, and public administration is now being handled by an army of foreigners. However, their actions really have improved the situation. I only hope they won't decide to extend their stay in Mendev once the war is over.\"",
    "AssetId": "9980a1ecf3ca24e42ab3b22f858677b5",
    "Data": {
      "$type": "8eee9d45ddcfa614d99610c1892993e3, BlueprintCue",
